    <string name="game_journey">Journey</string>
    <string name="howto_journey">A calm adventure in turns. Choose a hero and a name, travel the map, open chests and meet friends. In battles nobody hurries: Attack, cast Magic, Defend or use an Item. Each enemy has a weak spot, and Best move suggests a good play. If the group faints, it wakes up rested at the inn with nothing lost.</string>
