    <string name="journey_saci">Talk to Saci</string>
    <string name="journey_tip_1">Saci laughs: “Each enemy fears a kind of magic. Try them all: a big icon shows what works!”</string>
    <string name="journey_tip_2">Saci laughs: “When mana runs low, Defend: you get a little back.”</string>
    <string name="journey_tip_3">Saci laughs: “Bento can protect the others. Let him take the blows!”</string>
    <string name="journey_tip_4">Saci laughs: “Battles you have won can be played again, to grow stronger.”</string>
    <string name="journey_tip_5">Saci laughs: “Fainting is no shame: you wake up here at the inn, with everything you had.”</string>
